          },
          "code": "DATACONVERSION",
          "id": "1768376701153",
          "inputs": [
            {
              "id": "1768376701154_1",
              "name": "prompt",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "Normalize {{$context.$nodes.FORLOOP.$output}} using the following steps:\n\n1. Initialize an empty object called resultMap.\n\n2. For each element in {{$context.$nodes.FORLOOP.$output}}:\n   - If the element is a string, parse it as JSON.\n   - If the parsed object contains a \"result\" field:\n     - Extract result.id → id (convert to string)\n     - Extract result.summary → summary\n     - Do not preserve \"console\"\n     - Do not preserve \"timedOut\"\n\n3. Add an entry to resultMap using the id as the key:\n   - resultMap[id] = {\n       \"summary\": summary\n     }\n\n4. Do NOT return an array.\n\n5. Return ONLY the final JSON object (resultMap).\n\nSTRICT OUTPUT RULES:\n- Output must be valid raw JSON.\n- Do NOT wrap the response in markdown.\n- Do NOT include ```json or ``` in the output.\n- Do NOT include explanations.\n- The response must start with { and end with }."
            }
          ],
          "type": "LLM"
        }
      ],
